{
    "name": "Storage",
    "category": "tfc:logistics",
    "icon": "tfc:wood/chest/douglas_fir",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(9)Item Storage$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#chests)Chests$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#crates)Crates$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#vaults)Vaults$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_chests)Super Chests$()$(li)$(bold)$(9)Item & Fluid Storage$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#ae2)ME Storage$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#kegs)Kegs$()$(li)$(bold)$(9)Fluid Storage$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#barrels)Barrels$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#drums)Drums$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#fluid_tanks)Fluid Tanks$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#multiblock_tanks)Multiblock Tanks$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_tanks)Super Tanks$()",
            "title": "Index",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "Introduction",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "text": "There are a vast amount of items, materials, and fluids that you will accumulate in $(bold)$(#ff0fb7)TerraFirma$(#595959)Greg$(). It will be important to set up vast storage systems to organize everything. Some of the most important aspects of storage is its $(thing)capacity$() and $(thing)restrictions$(). For on-the-go inventory management you should read up on $(l:logistics/personal_storage)Personal Storage$()."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Chests",
            "anchor": "chests",
            "item": "tag:forge:chests",
            "text": "Chest can store 18 items or 36 items for double chests. Chests can hold item sized up to $(l:game_mechanics/size_and_weight)Large$().$(br)If $(thing)Food Items$() are present in chests then it will attract rodents. So it is best to store them in $(item)Vessels$()."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Chests come in all wood varients!",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "Y"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "Y": "#forge:chests/wooden[facing=north,type=single]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Crates",
            "anchor": "crates",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:crates",
            "text": "For storage, GregTech has $(item)Crates$() which can hold all sizes of items, with advancing tiers having larger capacity, from 27 to 144 slots.$(br)Crates support logistics covers such as $(thing)Item Filters$(), and $(thing)Rotten Voiding Covers$().$(br)You can even wrap crates with $(item)Tape$() to keep their contents when broken, allowing you to transport large quantities of items."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Wooden crates are quite cheap and make for good log storage.",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:crates"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Vaults",
            "anchor": "vaults",
            "item": "create:item_vault",
            "text": "Create $(item)Vaults$() are a great method for consolidating a large amount of items, or for adding storage to $(thing)moving contraptions$().$(br)Vaults can be built into large 3D structures to expand their storage by 20 slots per vault. You cannot add/remove items to vaults manually, you will need to use item logistics such as hoppers."
        },
        {
            "type": "tfc:multimultiblock",
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): $(item)Shipping Containers$() are a colorful alternative to vaults.",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
