        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Super Chests",
            "anchor": "super_chests",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:super_chests",
            "text": "Super and Quantum chests are the best way to store and absurd quantity of one item type. The amount of items the chest can hold increases per tier, from 10,000 to 1,024,000,000. Super chests also have built in item voiding, locking, and auto-extraction options."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Super chests can be picked up with items inside.",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:super_chests"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "ME Storage",
            "anchor": "ae2",
            "item": "ae2:drive",
            "text": "Advanced Energistics $(item)Drives$() and $(item)Cells$() allow you to digitize your storage into a very capable and dense logistics and crafting network. Connect an $(item)ME Controller$() and $(thing)Terminal$() to view items inside."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Higher tier cells can fit more item types, and more \"bytes\".",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "ae2:drive"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Kegs",
            "anchor": "kegs",
            "item": "tag:firmalife:big_barrels",
            "text": "$(item)Kegs$() have the unique ability to store large amounts of items $(italics)and$() fluids.$(br)Kegs can hold any fluid a barrel can, up to 80,000 mB worth. And can hold up to 36 stacks of $(l:game_mechanics/size_and_weight)Large$() items.$(br2)Kegs cannot process recipes or age alcohol like barrels."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): You can insert and extract automatically from the front-bottom-left block of the keg.",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "67",
                        "45"
                    ],
                    [
                        "23",
                        "01"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "0": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=0]",
                    "1": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=1]",
                    "2": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=2]",
                    "3": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=3]",
                    "4": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=4]",
                    "5": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=5]",
                    "6": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=6]",
                    "7": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=7]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Barrels",
            "anchor": "barrels",
            "item": "tag:tfc:barrels",
            "text": "$(l:craftsmanship/barrels)Barrels$() aren't just useful for recipes. They are a very cheap way of holding plenty of fluid. Up to 10,000 mB per barrel.$(br)When placed on their side, barrels can drip fluid from their tap into containers bellow. Allowing them to auto-ouput at a steady rate.$(br)You can carry a filled barrel on your back to transport its contents."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Barrels can collect rain water when left open exposed to the sky.",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#tfc:barrels[facing=up]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "Drums",
            "anchor": "drums",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:drums",
            "text": "$(item)Drums$() are great for storing and carrying fluids. These can hold a large amount of a single fluid type, and different tiers hold more, from 32,000 to 1,024,000 mB worth.$(br2)Drums will retain their fluid when broken, making them ideal for moving fluids around.$(br2)Drums can automatically push fluid out of their bottom face by $(item)$(k:key.use)$() them with a $(thing)Soft Mallet$() or $(thing)Screwdriver$()."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)TIP$(): Drums can have fluid logistic covers placed on their faces.",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:drums"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Fluid Tanks",
            "anchor": "fluid_tanks",
            "item": "create:fluid_tank,fluidlogistics:multi_fluid_tank",
            "text": "$(item)Fluid Tanks$() can be seen as the fluid version of $(l:logistics/storage#vaults)Vaults$(). Individual tanks hold 32,000 mB each. And can be formed into structures to expand their capacity.$(br2)$(item)Multi-Fluid Tanks$() can hold multiple fluid types at a time. But cannot be interacted with manually."
        },
