            "title": "Multiblock Tanks",
            "anchor": "multiblock_tanks",
            "item": "gtceu:wooden_multiblock_tank,gtceu:bronze_multiblock_tank,gtceu:steel_multiblock_tank",
            "text": "$(item)Multiblock Tanks$() are structures dedicated to storing large quantities of fluids. Each type can have up to two valves and increase in capacity by tier.$(li)$(bold)Wooden Tank$(): 1,000,000 mB Capacity$(li)$(bold)Bronze Tank$(): 4,000,000 mB Capacity$(li)$(bold)Steel Tank$(): 8,000,000 mB Capacity"
        },
