        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "Super Tanks",
            "anchor": "super_tanks",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:super_tanks",
            "text": "Super and Quantum tanks work similarly to their $(l:logistics/storage#super_chests)Super Chest$() counterparts. They can store an absurd amount of one type of fluid―ranging from 1,000,000 to 1,024,000,000 mb―increasing by tier.$(br)Super Tanks have options for auto-output, voiding, and locking."
        },
